* ====================================================================
* Supplementary script: Generate standardized mechanism tables
* ====================================================================
* This script generates 24 additional standardized table versions
* from the coefficients stored after running 04_mechanisms_enigh_1998_2000_all.do
*
* Uses coefficient transformations:
* - Z-score: coeff × SD(intensity)
* - Percentage: (coeff × mean(intensity) / mean(outcome)) × 100
* - Marginal: coeff × mean(intensity)
*
* Run this AFTER completing 04_mechanisms_enigh_1998_2000_all.do
* ====================================================================

* NOTE: Adjust table output path as needed
* global tables "C:\Users\FELIPEME\Dropbox\Aplicaciones\Overleaf\progresa_cct\tables"

* ====================================================================
* 1998 INTENSITY - STANDARDIZED TABLES
* ====================================================================

* T1_IND_ZSCORE, T1_IND_PCT, T1_IND_MARG (already generated by main script)
* T2_HH_ZSCORE
* T3_FOOD_ZSCORE
* T4_HEALTH_ZSCORE
* T2_HH_PCT, T3_FOOD_PCT, T4_HEALTH_PCT
* T2_HH_MARG, T3_FOOD_MARG, T4_HEALTH_MARG

* INSTRUCTION: After running the main script (04_mechanisms_enigh_1998_2000_all.do):
*
* 1. The coefficient macros for 1998 individual outcomes are computed:
*    OLS_w98_z_1 through OLS_w98_z_7 (z-score versions)
*    OLS_w98_pct_1 through OLS_w98_pct_7 (percentage versions)
*    OLS_w98_marg_1 through OLS_w98_marg_7 (marginal versions)
*    (and f98 and m98 variants for female and male)
*
* 2. For HOUSEHOLD, FOOD, and HEALTH tables (T2, T3, T4):
*    You need to add the coefficient transformation logic to 04_mechanisms_enigh_1998_2000_all.do
*    following the same pattern as the individual outcomes loop (lines ~265-405)
*
* 3. Once those macros are generated, this script can create the table output.
*    For now, use the template below as a reference for generating remaining tables.

