* ====================================================================
* INSTRUCTIONS FOR COMPLETING ALL 24 TABLES
* ====================================================================
*
* Step 1: Modify 04_mechanisms_enigh_1998_2000_all.do to compute
*         coefficient transformations for household (T2), food (T3),
*         and health (T4) outcomes, following the pattern from
*         individual outcomes (lines ~265-405).
*
* Step 2: Add table output sections for each standardized version.
*         You can copy-paste the T1_IND_ZSCORE/PCT/MARG table code
*         and adapt column names and macro references.
*
* Step 3: Repeat for 2000 intensity (inten2000) across all 4 outcomes.
*
* Required modifications to main script for EACH outcome set (T2, T3, T4):
*
* A. In regression loops, compute:
*    - coef_raw = _b[...coefficient...]
*    - coef_zscore = coef_raw * SD_intensity
*    - coef_pct = (coef_raw * mean_intensity / mean_outcome) * 100
*    - coef_marg = coef_raw * mean_intensity
*
* B. Format and store in macros (w98_z, w98_pct, w98_marg, etc.)
*
* C. Create 3 new table sections for each outcome set
*    (zscore, pct, marg versions)
*
* D. Repeat for 2000 intensity using inten2000 and w00 macro prefixes

